*.pyc
*.swp
.DS_Store
.atom/
.build/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
.swiftpm/

# Xcode regenerates xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved as scratch every time it
# opens a project, and `.swiftpm/` above does NOT match that path — so the files
# reappear untracked after every Xcode session, waiting to be swept into a `git add`.
# That is how two stale Firebase/app-check lockfiles landed in d222d03 and tripped the
# pre-push gate (tool/check_swiftpm_lockfile.dart, RULE 1 — the PR #69 class).
# Neither Xcode project declares a remote SwiftPM package, so these pin nothing.
# If a real remote dependency is ever added, RULE 2 (declared ⊆ pinned) fires loudly
# and the answer is to un-ignore the lockfile, not to weaken the gate.
**/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved
migrate_working_dir/

# IntelliJ related
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/

# The .vscode folder contains launch configuration and tasks you configure in
